    "timed_scope": "The two BoringCache Cargo release operations, including restore, build, and any permitted publication. Fresh changed-source consumers use restore-only trust; rolling jobs permit publication to the declared cohort. Output verification and unrelated setup are excluded. This is a correctness proof, not a provider timing comparison.",
